+            CMAC is analogous to OMAC1 - see also en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CMAC
+            </p><p>
+            CMAC is a NIST recomendation - see 
+            csrc.nist.gov/CryptoToolkit/modes/800-38_Series_Publications/SP800-38B.pdf
