+            (<see cref="M:Org.BouncyCastle.Math.BinPoly.BinPolys.Size(System.Int32)"/>, <see cref="M:Org.BouncyCastle.Math.BinPoly.BinPolys.Create(System.Int32)"/>, <c>Add</c>, <c>AddTo</c>) sit at the
