+        <member name="T:Org.BouncyCastle.Asn1.X509.CertificateList">
+             PKIX RFC-2459
+            
+             The X.509 v2 CRL syntax is as follows.  For signature calculation,
+             the data that is to be signed is ASN.1 Der encoded.
+            
+             <pre>
