+            Pick the most specialised <see cref="T:Org.BouncyCastle.Math.BinPoly.IBinPolyMul"/> impl for the given size:
+            fixed-size (<see cref="T:Org.BouncyCastle.Math.BinPoly.X86.V128.Size1"/>..<see cref="T:Org.BouncyCastle.Math.BinPoly.X86.V128.Size10"/>),
