+            The Holder object.
+            <pre>
+            Holder ::= SEQUENCE {
+                baseCertificateID   [0] IssuerSerial OPTIONAL,
+                    -- the issuer and serial number of
+                    -- the holder's Public Key Certificate
+                entityName          [1] GeneralNames OPTIONAL,
+                    -- the name of the claimant or role
