+            <see cref="T:Org.BouncyCastle.Cms.CmsAuthenticatedGenerator"/> methods, then call <see cref="M:Org.BouncyCastle.Cms.CmsAuthenticatedDataStreamGenerator.Open(System.IO.Stream,System.String)"/> to obtain a
